Maintainer: Brendan Gongol <8220574+brendangongol@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Downloads, harmonizes, and batch-processes transcriptomic,
    proteomic, methylation, and metabolomic data from public repositories.
    The package creates integrated data objects and provides a Shiny
    application for lightweight quality control and exploratory analysis.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
